 306:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *
 307:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** * Summary:
 308:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *  Sets flags that control the operating mode of the clock. This function only
 309:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *  changes flags from 0 to 1; flags that are already 1 will remain unchanged.
 310:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *  To clear flags, use the ClearModeRegister function. The clock must be
 311:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *  disabled before changing the mode.
 312:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *
 313:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** * Parameters:
 314:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *  clkMode: Bit mask containing the bits to set. For PSoC 3 and PSoC 5,
 315:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *   clkMode should be a set of the following optional bits or'ed together.
 316:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *   - CYCLK_EARLY Enable early phase mode. Rising edge of output clock will
 317:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *                 occur when the divider count reaches half of the divide
 318:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *                 value.
 319:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *   - CYCLK_DUTY  Enable 50% duty cycle output. When enabled, the output clock
 320:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *                 is asserted for approximately half of its period. When
 321:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *                 disabled, the output clock is asserted for one period of the
 322:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *                 source clock.
 323:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *   - CYCLK_SYNC  Enable output synchronization to master clock. This should
 324:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *                 be enabled for all synchronous clocks.
 325:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *   See the Technical Reference Manual for details about setting the mode of
 326:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *   the clock. Specifically, see the CLKDIST.DCFG.CFG2 register.
 327:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *
 328:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** * Returns:
 329:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *  None
ARM GAS  C:\Users\elias\AppData\Local\Temp\ccneE2gd.s 			page 63


 330:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *
 331:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** *******************************************************************************/
 332:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** void timer_clock_5_SetModeRegister(uint8 modeBitMask) 
 333:Generated_Source\PSoC5/timer_clock_5.c **** {
